  "source_text": "Hi. Can I help you? Hi. I picked up this shirt yesterday, and there's still a stain on it. It's the second time this has happened. Oh, I'm sorry. Yes, I can see it. When was the first time? Two weeks ago, with my white shirt. You cleaned it again and it was fine, but now it's happened again with this one. I'm really sorry. We can clean it again for free. It will be ready tomorrow at five. The problem is, I need it for a job interview tomorrow morning at nine. Tomorrow at five is too late. I see. In that case, we can do an express clean. It can be ready today at six, or tomorrow at eight in the morning. Both are free. Eight is too close to my interview, so I'll come back today at six. Could you check it carefully this time, please? Of course. I'll check it myself before you come. Thank you. So it'll be ready today at six, and there's no charge. That's right. Good luck with your interview!",
  "source_turns": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "Hi. Can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "speaker": "Learner",
      "text": "Hi. I picked up this shirt yesterday, and there's still a stain on it. It's the second time this has happened."
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "Oh, I'm sorry. Yes, I can see it. When was the first time?"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "speaker": "Learner",
      "text": "Two weeks ago, with my white shirt. You cleaned it again and it was fine, but now it's happened again with this one."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "I'm really sorry. We can clean it again for free. It will be ready tomorrow at five."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "speaker": "Learner",
      "text": "The problem is, I need it for a job interview tomorrow morning at nine. Tomorrow at five is too late."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "I see. In that case, we can do an express clean. It can be ready today at six, or tomorrow at eight in the morning. Both are free."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "speaker": "Learner",
      "text": "Eight is too close to my interview, so I'll come back today at six. Could you check it carefully this time, please?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "Of course. I'll check it myself before you come."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "speaker": "Learner",
      "text": "Thank you. So it'll be ready today at six, and there's no charge."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "That's right. Good luck with your interview!"
    }
  ],
